; The chat is a buffer of its own mode, named after its folder, and
; linked to Pi's process. Its prompt's edits are history; the
; conversation's rewrites are silent.
> (list (buffers:name b) (modes:major-mode b) (eq? (chat:conversation-of b) chat) (eq? (processes:buffer (pi:chat-process chat)) b))
